sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant A as NestJS API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant R as Private R2
    B->>A: POST /v1/transfers (validated metadata)
    A->>D: Atomically check quota + reserve bytes + create transfer
    A-->>B: One-time management secret + signed PUT URLs
    B->>R: PUT objects directly (max 3 concurrent)
    B->>A: Complete (management bearer)
    A->>D: CAS state to VERIFYING
    A->>R: HEAD expected keys + sizes/checksums
    A->>D: CAS READY if valid, unexpired, not cancelled
    B->>A: Recipient opens share token
    A-->>B: Locked response if password-protected
    B->>A: Verify password (rate-limited)
    A->>D: Validate Argon2id; create short grant
    A-->>B: HttpOnly Secure SameSite cookie
    B->>A: Request file download (share token + grant)
    A->>D: Verify READY + expiry + grant
    A-->>B: Signed GET URL (<=60s)
    B->>R: GET file directly
